---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../../site.config.mjs';
import { url } from '../lib';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Encrypted Cat Games"
  description="Terms of service for the Encrypted Cat Games website and Encrypted Cat Studio."
>
  <article class="container article legal">
    <header class="article-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
      <h1>Terms of service.</h1>
      <p>Website and app terms · Updated November 8, 2026</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        These terms cover this website and Encrypted Cat Studio, both run by
        Encrypted Cat Games (Encrypted Cat / 0xKOT). By using them you agree to
        these terms. Questions:{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>The website</h2>
      <p>
        You may browse the site and share links to it. Games, artwork, articles,
        and other content here belong to Encrypted Cat Games unless stated
        otherwise, and may not be republished without permission. Games bought
        or played on other stores (itch.io, the App Store) follow those stores’
        terms as well.
      </p>
      <h2 id="studio">Encrypted Cat Studio</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={url('studio/')}>Encrypted Cat Studio</a> is an internal tool
        for the Encrypted Cat Games team. Only accounts the team owns or
        controls may be connected to it. Using it means following these terms
        and the terms of each connected service, including the{' '}
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms">YouTube Terms of Service</a>,
        the{' '}
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>,
        and the{' '}
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/legal/terms-of-service">
          TikTok Terms of Service
        </a>
        . Encrypted Cat Studio uses YouTube API Services.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can disconnect an account at any time from{' '}
        <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">
          Google’s third-party access settings
        </a>
        , or from TikTok’s app settings. How the Studio handles account data is
        described in the <a href={url('privacy/#studio')}>privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        The website and the Studio are provided as they are, without warranties
        of any kind. To the extent the law allows, Encrypted Cat Games is not
        liable for indirect or consequential losses from using them.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms; the date at the top shows the latest version.
        Continuing to use the website or the Studio after a change means
        accepting the new terms.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="text-link" href={url('contact/')}>
          Contact Encrypted Cat Games
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
